{{- /* Phonebook download (phone-feature-parity S-31), keys per Grandstream's own templates (2026-11-09 review). P330 = Enable Phonebook XML Download, 3 = HTTPS in every WP template (the WP856 numbers 1 TFTP, 2 HTTP, 3 HTTPS and the WP8x6 1 HTTP, 2 TFTP, 3 HTTPS); P331 = server path (host/path, no scheme); P332 = download interval in minutes (WP8x6 and WP810/822/825: 0 or 5 to 720; WP820 and WP856: only 0, 5, 30, 60, 120, 240, 360, 480, 720, see BookRefreshForPhone). What the download does to entries already in the phone: P333 = Remove Manually-edited Entries on Download (0 No, 1 Yes, default 1) is in wp8x6_config_1.0.3.39 and wp810_822_825_config_1.0.11.83 and written 1, as Hello's directory is the source of truth; P8462 = Import Group Method (0 Replace, 1 Append, default 0) is in the WP8x6 template only and written 0, so a group in the downloaded XML replaces the phone's; the WP820 and WP856 templates have neither, but "Clear The Old List" P1435 (0 No, 1 Clear all, 2 Keep Local Contacts, default 0), which is written 1 for the same effect. P1436 (Replace Duplicate Items) stays at its default. */}}
{{- with .Book}}
    3
    {{xml .HostPath}}
    {{.RefreshMinutes}}
