{{- /* LDAP phonebook (pbx-gaps S-26): no template or guide in the references on hand lists the LDAP P-values for the WP8x6, WP856 or WP8xx, so P8020 to P8032 below are not confirmed on a phone (verify, needs hardware). They are written only to a phone in a group that turned LDAP on. */}}
